## Naming clarification

| Name | Scope |
|------|--------|
| **Enterprise Activity Registry (EAR)** | Universal chronology (CO-ORG-003) |
| **Conversation Activity Registry (ECIE)** | Transcripts / voice / typed notes only (ADR-021) |
| **EDC Timeline** | Projection / compose surface — dual-writes to EAR; hydrate from EAR |
| **Deal Timeline** | Deal-domain append-only ledger — dual-writes to EAR |
| **OrganizationActivityEvent** | Org MDM domain ledger — dual-writes to EAR |

## Forbidden

- New dashboard / Mission Control / Dialogue **placeholder** activity feeds as production truth  
- Parallel “activity engines” that reimplement chronology outside EAR  
- Expanding `EnterpriseConversationActivity` into universal activity storage  

